WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:09.500
Xie Xuan led troops in a night raid on the Wunu West Camp. By the time the headquarters of the East Camp received the news, Xie Xuan had already set fire to two rows of military tents and turned back to retreat.

00:10.200 --> 00:17.000
However, the disparity in troop numbers was vast. Although Xie Xuan broke out in time, dozens of men fell behind and were pinned down by Wunu soldiers.

00:17.800 --> 00:24.000
Seeing the elites of the Eastern Camp approaching rapidly, Xie Xuan gritted his teeth and turned back, determined to seize what time remained to rescue his brothers from entrapment.

00:24.800 --> 00:31.000
The burning Wunu tents were conspicuous in the night. Yet after waiting long without Xie Xuan returning, your heart gradually sank to the bottom.

00:31.800 --> 00:39.000
In order to rescue his subordinates and break out, Xie Xuan was ultimately pinned down by enemy forces, and his entire unit was wiped out, causing the morale of the Yiyang garrison to plummet.

00:39.800 --> 00:43.500
Two days later, Yiyang fell...

00:46.040 --> 00:47.040
General

00:47.120 --> 00:49.520
Prince of Jin has been captured

00:51.240 --> 00:53.040
Good

00:53.720 --> 00:56.520
You've given me quite a few surprises

00:57.000 --> 00:57.920
General

00:58.000 --> 00:59.280
This time capturing Prince of Jin alive

00:59.360 --> 01:01.040
As long as we bring him to the western front

01:01.120 --> 01:01.760
Great Chanyu Ayidai

01:01.840 --> 01:03.080
Will certainly

01:03.160 --> 01:04.440
Stop nagging

01:04.520 --> 01:07.320
I don't need you to teach me

01:11.640 --> 01:13.307
I don't humiliate brave men

01:13.440 --> 01:14.280
Later

01:14.360 --> 01:15.560
Burn his body

01:15.640 --> 01:16.240
With this house

01:16.320 --> 01:17.720
Together
